@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Manejo Centralizado de Excepciones con Spring Boot (@RestControllerAdvice)

actor "Cliente (Frontend)" as Client
participant "DispatcherServlet (Spring MVC)" as Dispatcher
participant "SalmonMatchController" as Controller
participant "SalmonMatchService" as ServiceLayer
participant "ExceptionHandlerController (@RestControllerAdvice)" as AdviceHandler

== 1. Petición y Detección de Conflicto de Negocio ==

Client -> Dispatcher: PATCH /api/v1/salmonMatches/move-batch/{id}\n[Payload con movimientos no válidos]
activate Dispatcher

Dispatcher -> Controller: updateCoordinateBatch(id, moves)
activate Controller

Controller -> ServiceLayer: updateCoordinateBatch(id, moves)
activate ServiceLayer

ServiceLayer -> ServiceLayer: validateMoveRules(move)
note right
  Se detecta que el coste supera
  el saldo de energía del jugador.
end note

ServiceLayer --[#red]> Controller: throw new InsufficientEnergyException("Not enough energy")
deactivate ServiceLayer

Controller --[#red]> Dispatcher: Propagación de excepción no controlada
deactivate Controller

== 2. Intercepción Transversal y Mapeo de Respuesta ==

Dispatcher -> AdviceHandler: Resolver excepción mediante HandlerExceptionResolver
activate AdviceHandler
note over AdviceHandler
  @ExceptionHandler(InsufficientEnergyException.class)
  Transforma la excepción en una respuesta estructurada.
end note

AdviceHandler -> AdviceHandler: buildErrorMessage(HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST, exception.getMessage())
AdviceHandler --> Dispatcher: ResponseEntity (400 Bad Request, { "message": "Not enough energy" })
deactivate AdviceHandler

Dispatcher --> Client: HTTP 400 Bad Request\n{ "message": "Not enough energy", "status": 400 }
deactivate Dispatcher

Client -> Client: Renderiza notificación de error y ejecuta rollback de estado local

note over Client, AdviceHandler
  ref Diagrama 12 del Toolkit (12_Secuencia_Gestion_Excepciones_Global)
  Mecanismo transversal de captura y serialización de errores (@RestControllerAdvice).
end note

@enduml
